WEBVTT

00:09:59.273 --> 00:10:00.923
By "get identity capital,"

00:10:00.947 --> 00:10:04.567
I mean do something
that adds value to who you are.

00:10:05.305 --> 00:10:07.080
Do something that's an investment

00:10:07.104 --> 00:10:09.420
in who you might want to be next.

00:10:10.555 --> 00:10:12.906
I didn't know the future of Emma's career,

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:15.167
and no one knows the future of work,

00:10:15.191 --> 00:10:16.860
but I do know this:

00:10:16.884 --> 00:10:20.110
Identity capital begets identity capital.

00:10:20.632 --> 00:10:23.390
So now is the time
for that cross-country job,

00:10:23.414 --> 00:10:26.162
that internship, that startup
you want to try.

00:10:26.924 --> 00:10:30.353
I'm not discounting
twentysomething exploration here,